# Shipped defaults for the house-segment sinkhole. THIS FILE IS CODE,
# not operator state: `make pi-ship` overwrites it at each deploy, and
# the TUI cannot edit it. To change the defaults, change them here, in
# git, and ship.
#
# The house list is the union of three files, minus house_never_block:
#   house_default.domains    <- this file. shipped, overwritten
#   generated/house.domains  <- feeds with "segment": "house" (hagezi)
#   house.domains            <- the operator's own. never overwritten
# One name per line. dnsmasq answers 0.0.0.0 for the name and every
# subdomain. The agent segment reads none of these.
#
# To un-block one of these, do NOT delete the line: the next ship puts
# it back. Put the name in house_never_block.domains. That file stays
# after `make pi-ship`. Never-block matches a name and all names under
# it. Thus the apexes here are independent (to free youtube.com does not
# free youtu.be, ytimg.com or googlevideo.com). But a parent frees its
# children: googleapis.com there would free youtubei.googleapis.com.

youtube.com
youtu.be
youtube-nocookie.com
ytimg.com
googlevideo.com
youtubei.googleapis.com

chess.com
chesscomfiles.com

soundcloud.com
sndcdn.com
